 "stimulus_html": "<p>For questions 4 – 6, use the following scenario.</p>\n<blockquote><p>The Collegiate Review publishes information about colleges and universities. The data below are for six public 4-year colleges in New York. Graduation rate is the percentage of students who graduate within six years. Student-to-faculty ratio is the number of students per full-time faculty member.</p></blockquote>\n\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">School</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Number of Full-Time Students</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Student-to-Faculty Ratio</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Graduation Rate</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>CUNY Bernard M. Baruch College</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>11,477</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>17</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>63</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>CUNY Brooklyn College</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>9,876</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>15.3</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>48</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>CUNY City College</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>10,047</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>13.1</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>40</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>SUNY at Albany</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>14,013</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>19.5</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>64</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>SUNY at Binghamton</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>13,031</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>20</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>77</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>SUNY College at Buffalo</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>9,398</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>14.1</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>47</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n <br>",
